<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices rise 0.4 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices rise 0.4 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices rose 0.4 percent in February from January, for a year-on-year fall of 1.8 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p>(Percentage change)		Feb 97	  yr/yr</p>
<p>Export prices			0.5	    -3.2</p>
<p>Import prices		     -0.3	     0.2</p>
<p>Producer prices		    0.4	    -1.8</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to rise by 0.2 percent in February, according to a Reuter survey.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
